 bee)NC State students Ashtyn Thomas (Lumbee) and Victoria Wilson (Haliwa-S
 aponi)Gwen Locklear (Lumbee)Alexandra Williams (portrait photographs of Po
 wwows at Dix Park)Together\, these artists explore heritage\, craft and st
 orytelling as a living continuum of creativity\, connecting ancestral know
 ledge with contemporary expression.
