X-SOURCE:NC State Gregg Museum of Art & Design
DTSTAMP:20260801T035124Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53425545154182
DTSTART:20260814T130000Z
DTEND:20260814T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Gregg Museum of Art & Design’s annual sponsored poster sa
 le with Poster Invasion is back. The eight-day\, pop-up event will take pl
 ace outside Talley Student Union under the overhang facing Stafford Common
 s. Poster Invasion is a woman-owned business that offers a variety of art 
 prints and popular images in many sizes. Their collection features exclusi
 ve work from young\, rising visual artists. Proceeds will benefit the Greg
 g Museum.
GEO:35.784114;-78.671321
LOCATION:Talley Student Union
SUMMARY:Poster Invasion Sale 
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/poster-invasion-sale
CATEGORIES:Community Events
END:VEVENT
